00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,645
Which vial is stronger: ten milligrams, or five?

2
00:00:03,645 --> 00:00:04,726
Trick question.

3
00:00:04,726 --> 00:00:06,406
A vial has no strength.

4
00:00:06,406 --> 00:00:09,114
Ten milligrams is simply more peptide.

5
00:00:09,114 --> 00:00:12,460
At one milligram per draw, it lasts ten draws.

6
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:14,531
Five milligrams lasts five.

7
00:00:14,531 --> 00:00:17,083
And water never changes the amount.

8
00:00:17,083 --> 00:00:19,375
One milligram is one milligram.

9
00:00:19,375 --> 00:00:23,671
More water only means each draw takes more units to reach it.

